~ convo_1
Az: So, like,[wait=0.3] what are your powers? [wait=0.3]Controlling ice?
Winston: Um, not exactly. Tis ice [i]makers[/i]. I createth magical things! But I cannot quite [wait=0.3][i]controleth[/i] them...
Az: Wait, [wait=0.3]this is kind of a stretch. Do you know [color="B80006"]Palina Glover[/color]? Ice [color="8A0194"]Wizard[/color]? Owns Enginice?
Winston grit: [shake level=7 rate=20][i]Ugh.[/i][/shake] Do not remindeth me of my Mother's nameth.
Az laugh: [font_size=60]She's your [shake level=7 rate=30][i]MOM?![/i][/shake][/font_size]
Winston awkward: [font_size=60]WHAT?? [shake lever=7 rate=30]Why art thee star stricken?[/shake][/font_size]
Az laugh: [font_size=60]No [i]WAY![/i][/font_size] I've been [i]obsessed[/i] with Enginice since I was a kid! 
Az: I used to tinker with all their devices all the time!
Az laugh: One time, I turned the fridge into a fully functional oven. 
Az laugh: [color="B80006"]Baba[/color] came home to burnt steaks and soggy vegetables. [shake level=7 rate=30]It was AWESOME[/shake].
Winston: SERIOUSLY?! That's [wave freq=7 amp=30]SO COOL![/wave]
Winston awkward: Tis not [i]quite[/i] the sameth,[wait=0.3] but I once made snowmen using Mother's laundry device.
Az laugh: Really?? You [i]have[/i] to tell me how you did that.
Winston: Ha! [wave freq=7 amp=30]Why, of course![/wave]
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-1", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_2
Winston awkward: Az?
Az: 'Sup?
Winston awkward: I wanteth to apologize once more...
Az: Hey, [wait=0.3]don't worry about it, man.
Az: Sure, you tried to kill us.
Az: But you also gave me my inhaler, and got me closer to freeing my [color="B80006"]Baba[/color].
Winston grit: But I feeleth terrible! I forced thee to [shake level=7 rate=30]breath fire[/shake] when I [i]kneweth[/i] about thy asthma.
Az: You didn't [i]make[/i] me do anything. I lost my cool. You're good, dude.
Winston awkward: Well... alright. Thank you.
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-2", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_3
Az: Hey Fenn! Thanks for your help in the [color="0B4F4A"]Cellar[/color]. Appreciate it.
Fenn: Well, I couldn't have done much without your bangles, either...
Winston awkward: Sorry for, like, [wait=0.3]trying to killeth thee, [wait=0.3]and stuff...
Fenn starry: It wouldn't be an adventure without any danger!
Az laugh: Winston, you're good, [wait=0.3]don't worry about it.
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-3", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_4
Winston: May I taketh a look at thy bangles?
Az: Yeah sure.
Winston: Whoa... tis [shake level=7 rate=30]incredible![/shake]
Az: It's really nothing special.
Winston: No, seriously! [wave freq=7 amp=30]Thy patterns art so intricate and clean![/wave]
Winston: This must hath taken thee [shake level=7 rate=30][i]months![/i][/shake]
Az: It was a few weeks, but yeah...
Winston: [font_size=60][i]Weeks?![/i] Seriously?[/font_size][font_size=40] Whoa... [/font_size]
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-4", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_5
Az: Hey, Winston. I wanted to ask you something.
Winston awkward: What is on thy mind?
Az: The picture frame? In my [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color]?
Winston: [font_size=60]NO! [shake level=7 rate=30]Didst it break?[/shake] I apologize![/font_size]
Az: No![wait=0.3] Actually, the opposite. I thought you smashed it. I saw it in one piece before you made [color="521FA6"]Iceton[/color].
Winston awkward: Oh... I could not bring myself to breaketh it. [font_size=30]I[wait=0.3] smashed some ice instead.[/font_size]
Winston awkward: I'm sorry.
Az: Why? [wait=0.3]You didn't really do anything wrong.
Winston: Well... for scaring thee!
Az: Eh, [wait=0.3]water under the bridge, man.
Winston: Oh,[wait=0.3] alright. Thank you.
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-5", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_6
Az: So, Winston... you make things with ice, right?
Winston: Indeed.
Az: So all those things running around the [color="0B4F4A"]Cellar[/color]? That was you?
Winston awkward: Well, [font_size=40]yes...[/font_size]
Az laugh: [shake level=7 rate=30][font_size=60][i]Seriously?![/i][/font_size][/shake]
Winston: I hath many machines and molds to maketh them! 
Winston awkward: [font_size=40]If only they [wait=0.3]listened to me[/font_size]
Az: That's [shake level=7 rate=30][i]INCREDIBLE[/i][/shake], dude. I [i]wish[/i] blacksmithing was that cool.
Winston awkward: Perhaps we couldst, like, [wait=0.3][font_size=40]work together sometime?[/font_size]
Az: Yeah? That'd be [i]awesome![/i] It'd be like [i]"ice-smithing"[/i] or whatever.
Winston: [font_size=80][shake level=10 rate=50]WAIT REALLY??[/shake][/font_size]
Az laugh: Yeah, it'd be cool.
Winston awkward: Cool. Cool. Soundeth good. [font_size=40]Tis cool.[/font_size]
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-6", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_7
Az: Yo, Winston, I was wondering.
Az: I've never heard anyone, like,[wait=0.3] speak like you do. Where are you from?
Winston: Ah. Tis the snowy region, [color="0B4F4A"]Lumin[/color].
Az: Wait, [i]really?[/i] I've been on vacation there. It's pretty nice.
Az: But... I still haven't heard anyone talk like you.
Winston awkward: [i]sigh.[/i] Yes, I knoweth. [font_size=40]I didn't used to speaketh like this.[/font_size]
Az: Really?[wait=0.3] What changed?
Winston grit: Twas a ploy for [shake level=7 rate=30][i]my Mother's attention.[/i][/shake]
Winston awkward: It... did not work. 
Winston grit: Then it becameth a habit.
Az: Huh. I'm sorry, man, [wait=0.3]I didn't know.
Winston: Tis fine![wait=0.3] No one hath actually asked me before.
Az: Huh.
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-7", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ ending_convo
Az and Winston seem thoroughly engaged in conversation.
